Look at it this way:

You are a chaotic elf.  This limits possible artifacts to the following
chaotic artifacts: Grimtooth (which you'll never get because you're an
elf), Orcrist (you can make it), Sting (you have it), Stormbringer (you
have this too).

Or you might get the unaligned artifacts - Dragonbane, Firebrand,
Frostbrand, Ogresmasher, Trollbane, Werebane.

Of these the only ones I think worth getting are Frostbrand and
Firebrand, but Frosty is definitely better than Firebrand.  So are you
trying for a particular artifact, or are you just annoyed that you
aren't getting any?  From where I'm sitting none of the available
artifacts are that great.  Frostbrand is good because a lot of monsters
are fire resistant (x2 damage) and few are cold resistant (extra cold
damage).  *But*, Frosty destroys potions, which means less !oH, !oEH,
!oFH, !oGA, !oGL, !oW, !oHW, etc.  And as a priestess, you will only
get to basic in long sword anyhow.



